function bindAssetHistory(){if(view!=='assetHistory')return;const safe=(id,fn)=>{if($(id))$(id).onclick=()=>withButtonLock($(id),fn,e=>toast(e.message,true));};safe('#history-back',async()=>{view='p301';page=1;render();});safe('#history-refresh',loadAssetHistory);safe('#history-preview',async()=>{await document.fonts.load('16px "TH SarabunPSK"');historyPreviewDialog();});for(const key of ['historyYear','historyFunding','historyAsset']){const input=$('[name='+key+']');if(input)input.onchange=()=>{if(key==='historyYear')historyYear=input.value;if(key==='historyFunding')historyFunding=input.value;if(key==='historyAsset')[historyRoute,historyControl]=JSON.parse(input.value);page=1;void loadAssetHistory();};}$('#history-search')?.addEventListener('input',e=>{const pos=e.target.selectionStart;historyQuery=e.target.value;page=1;render();$('#history-search').focus();$('#history-search').setSelectionRange(pos,pos);});$$('[data-history-contract]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{const r=historyPayload.contractRegistry.find(r=>r.id===b.dataset.historyContract);modal('รายละเอียดสัญญา · '+r.contract,registryDetailHTML(state,r));$('#modal').style.width='1040px';$$('#modal [data-toggle-detail-tools],#modal [data-manage-people],#modal [data-detail-tools]').forEach(x=>x.remove());});const table=$('.asset-history-table');if(table)selectionAdapters.set(table.dataset.selectionKey,async ids=>{const rows=historyRows().filter(r=>ids.includes(r.id));await document.fonts.load('16px "TH SarabunPSK"');download(assetHistoryXlsxBlob(historyPayload.asset,rows,{...state.settings.p301,layout:state.settings.p301.historyLayouts?.[historyFunding]||{},year:historyYear==='all'?null:Number(historyYear)}),'ประวัติทรัพย์สิน-ที่เลือก.xlsx','application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.spreadsheetml.sheet');});if(!historyPayload&&!historyLoading&&!historyError)void loadAssetHistory();}
